# Local-only visual harness for /platform (fixtures + fixture-backed
# fetch mock), used to review the redesign without a live backend.
# Never referenced by router.tsx/main.tsx, so it never reaches the
# production bundle either way — gitignored so it also never reaches
# a commit. Named explicitly (not the whole apps/web/src/dev/
# directory) so a real, committed file placed there later isn't
# silently swallowed.
